 the road curves into the hillside","and joins the expressway on toward Guiyang."],"time":"2026-11-18 10:50","time1":"10:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":24,"move":"orbit","at":"river","alt":650,"dist":2800,"from":200,"arc":30,"pitch":-12,"zh":["橋下的峽谷屬於北盤江水系，","貴州一帶有許多跨越深谷的高橋。"],"en":["The gorge below belongs to the Beipan River system;","Guizhou is known for many high bridges over deep valleys."],"time":"2026-11-18 11:00","time1":"11:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":32,"move":"orbit","at":"main","alt":520,"dist":2600,"from":250,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"zh":["接下來三部影片，看它的結構、施工與影響。","橋面高度與邊跨橋墩為依公開資料的估計。","本片為電腦擬真重建：結構依公開資料簡化建模，","地形取自公開高程資料，不是實地空拍畫面。"],"en":["The next three films look at its structure, its construction and its impact.","Deck level and side-span piers are estimates from public data.","A computer reconstruction: the structures are simplified models built from public data,","and the terrain comes from public elevation data. This is not real drone footage."],"time":"2026-11-18 11:10","time1":"11:15","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}}]},{"id":"works-structure","theme":"works-structure","title":{"zh-Hant":"北盤江第一橋：結構與技術","en":"Duge Bridge: Structure"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"H 形塔、雙索面與鋼桁梁","en":"H-shaped towers, two cable planes and a steel truss"},"time":"2026-11-18 13:30","weather":"clear","season":"autumn","shots":[{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"main","weather":"few","alt":150,"dist":1500,"from":130,"arc":40,"pitch":-6,"zh":["北盤江第一橋是雙塔斜張橋：","兩座塔各自用鋼索拉住一半的主跨。"],"en":["The bridge is a two-tower cable-stayed bridge:","each tower holds up half of the main span with its cables."],"time":"2026-11-18 13:30","time1":"13:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":32,"move":"rise","at":"north","alt0":10,"alt":160,"dist":320,"from":330,"arc":20,"pitch":0,"zh":["橋塔呈 H 形，兩支塔柱立在橋面兩側，","上下以橫梁連接。"],"en":["The towers are H-shaped: two legs stand either side of the deck,","tied together by cross-beams."],"time":"2026-11-18 13:40","time1":"13:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"south","alt":80,"dist":340,"from":160,"arc":-60,"pitch":2,"zh":["鋼索共 112 對，排成兩個面，","從塔的上半段呈扇形散開，連到橋面兩側。"],"en":["There are 112 pairs of cables in two planes,","fanning out from the upper tower to both edges of the deck."],"time":"2026-11-18 13:50","time1":"13:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"track","at":"main","alt":-6,"dist":220,"from":310,"arc":40,"pitch":4,"zh":["主梁是高 8 公尺的鋼桁梁，漆成橘色，","桁架輕而剛，適合大跨度與強風的山谷。"],"en":["The deck is a steel truss girder 8 m deep, painted orange;","a truss is light and stiff, suited to long spans and windy valleys."],"time":"2026-11-18 14:00","time1":"14:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"main","alt":40,"dist":300,"from":220,"arc":60,"pitch":-4,"zh":["橋面寬 27.9 公尺，雙向四車道。","主跨中央距離兩座塔最遠，鋼索也最長。"],"en":["The deck is 27.9 m wide, with two lanes each way.","The middle of the span is farthest from the towers, where the cables are longest."],"time":"2026-11-18 14:10","time1":"14:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"south","alt":60,"dist":520,"from":260,"arc":40,"pitch":-6,"zh":["邊跨由三座橋墩支撐，桁架內還灌入混凝土配重，","平衡主跨的拉力，讓橋塔保持直立。"],"en":["Each side span rests on three piers, with concrete counterweights in its truss,